{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2022-05-31 08:00:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP CHANGE IN ASIA PACIFIC REGION', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA , MAY 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC) HAS ANNOUNCED THAT BETHWYN TODD, FMC VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT OF FMC ASIA PACIFIC, HAS DECIDED TO LEAVE THE COMPANY FOR HEALTH REASONS.\xa0 PRAMOD THOTA, PRESIDENT OF FMC U.S.A.'}